<title>GERMANY: Swiss Metro 1996 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Swiss Metro 1996 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar year:</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   992.04  vs 853.35</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		   1,630   vs 1,440</p>
<p>    Group income from ord. activities    1,560   vs 1,330</p>
<p>    Group sales				  76,410  vs 75,120</p>
<p>    Group net sales (1)			67,830  vs 66,740</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the Swiss retail group is Metro Holding</p>
<p>AG. (1) Sales adjusted for value added tax.</p>
</text>
